        "data": {
          "instanceTitle": "Deep CRL — notes",
          "text": "# Deep CRL — residual MLP for contrastive RL\n\nThis graph shows how **`crl_residual_mlp`** plugs into **`crl_trainer`** with the CPU **`crl_env_config`** (point U4 maze, same topology as scaling-crl).\n\n- **Depth**: `actorDepth` / `criticDepth` count **Dense** layers; each **4** layers form one **residual** block (4× Linear→LayerNorm→Swish/ReLU, then skip). Use **multiples of 4** only. This template uses **16** (four blocks) per tower — deeper than the default **4**.\n- **Widths**: wider hidden layers (`actorWidth` / `criticWidth`) trade compute for capacity; tune together with depth.\n- **Code**: `comfy_research/engine/crl_networks.py` (agent + encoders), `crl_run.py` (loop).\n- **Upstream**: [wang-kevin3290/scaling-crl](https://github.com/wang-kevin3290/scaling-crl)"
        }
      },
